        avgTime: "01:25",
        question: "Consider the following sentences:\n(A) India must take its laws on waste seriously to stop microplastics pollution.\n(B) India must take its laws on waste serious to stop microplastics pollution.\n(C) India must take seriously its laws on waste to stop microplastics pollution.\n(D) The laws must be took seriously to stop microplastics pollution.\nWhich of the above sentences is/are grammatically CORRECT?",
