        question: "Select the most appropriate option to fill in the blanks.\nThere\u2019s more than the 101 - seater dining table at the Falaknuma palace that is awe ______. The library done in rosewood and mahogany is a place that will force anyone to ______, if only to admire the fine original polish, the furniture and the walnut carved high roof. The last is supposedly an ______ of the one at Windsor Castle.",
