        question: "Directions: Each item in this section has a sentence with three underlined parts labelled (a), (b) and (c). Read each sentence to find out whether there is any error in any underlined part. Indicate your response in the Answer Sheet against the corresponding letter, i.e., (a) or (b) or (c). If you find no error, your response should be indicated as (d). An provision of quality education(A)/ and healthcare services(B)/ must be considered as a basic need for all individuals.(C)/ No error(D)",
