        question: "Amit borrowed a sum of \u20B925,000 on simple interest. Bhola borrowed the same amount on compound interest (interest compounded yearly). At the end of 2 years, Bhola had to pay \u20B9160 more interest than Amit. The rate of interest charged per annum is:",
