        solution: "We know that tangents drawn from the same point are equal.\n\nSo,\n\nXB = XA = 4.2 cm\nYZ = 8 cm\nYC = 3.2 cm\nSo, CZ = YZ - YC = 8 - 3.2 = 4.8 and so, BZ = 4.8 cm\nYC = YA = 3.2 cm\nPerimeter of Triangle XYZ = XY + YZ + ZA = (4.2 + 3.2) + 8 + (4.8 + 4.2) = 24.4 cm",
