        question: "Aman started a business investing 70000 rs. Rakhi joined him after six months with an amount of 105000 rs. and Sagar joined them with 1.4 lakhs rs. after another six months. The amount of profit earned should be distributed in what ratio among Aman, Rakhi and Sagar respectively, 3 years after Aman started the business?",
