        question: "An annular road is about to build on the circular park. The outer radius of the circular park is $\\sqrt{65}\\text{ m}$ and the inner radius of the circular park is $4\\text{ m}$. If the speed of the construction is $4.4\\text{ m}^2/\\text{hour}$, find the time taken by the construction company to complete the task.",
