        question: "What is the value of \\(\\dfrac{3}{5} \\times \\left[ {\\left( {\\overline {\\dfrac{9}{14} + \\dfrac{3}{7}} \\times \\dfrac{7}{15}} \\right) - \\dfrac{3}{5}} \\right]\\)?",
