        userTime: "00:02",
        avgTime: "00:22",
        question: "2 tables and 3 chairs together cost \u20B912000. When the cost of a table is decreased by 10% and that of a chair is increased by 20%, then 3 tables and 4 chairs together cost \u20B917100. What is the total original cost of 1 table and 2 chairs?",
