        question: "Let \\Delta ABC \\sim \\Delta PQR and \\frac{\\text{ar}(\\Delta ABC)}{\\text{ar}(\\Delta QPR)} = \\frac{25}{144}. If AB = 12 cm, BC = 7 cm and AC = 9 cm, then PR (in cm) is equal to:",
