        question: "If in the number sequence 8 3 2 1 6 2 4 3 7 1 7 2 all the odd numbers are increased by two and all the even numbers are decreased by two, then the new number sequence is arranged in ascending order, which will be the fifth number from the left?\nOptions:\nA: 3\nB: 2\nC: 4\nD: 5",
