        answer: "d",
        solution: "Solution\n\nThe correct answer is K Sanjay Murthy.\n\nKey Points\nK Sanjay Murthy was appointed as the Comptroller General of India in November 2024.\nThe Comptroller General of India is a crucial constitutional authority responsible for auditing the revenue and expenditure of the Government of India.\nK Sanjay Murthy has previously served in key administrative roles, contributing significantly to public administration and governance.\nThis appointment was made to ensure the effective management and oversight of public funds, enhancing transparency and accountability.\nThe Comptroller General of India operates under the provisions of Article 148 of the Indian Constitution.\n\nAdditional Information\nComptroller and Auditor General of India (CAG):\nThe CAG is an independent authority established under Article 148 of the Constitution of India.\nThe primary function of the CAG is to audit all receipts and expenditures of the Government of India and the state governments, including those of autonomous bodies and corporations.\nThe CAG reports are submitted to the President or Governors, who then table them in Parliament or state legislatures.\nThe CAG plays a key role in ensuring transparency and accountability in the financial administration of the government.\nRoles and Responsibilities of the Comptroller General of India:\nOverseeing the financial administration of India at the highest level.\nEnsuring that public funds are used effectively and for the intended purposes.\nPromoting fiscal discipline within government departments and agencies.\nAuditing government expenditures to identify inefficiencies, corruption, or misuse of funds.\nAppointment of Comptroller General:\nThe Comptroller General is appointed by the President of India.\nThe term of office is six years or until the age of 65, whichever is earlier.\nThe independence of the office is ensured by providing security of tenure and prohibiting the holder from subsequent appointments under the government.\nSignificance of the Role:\nThe Comptroller General ensures the integrity and transparency of public financial management.\nIt plays a vital role in maintaining the trust of the public in the government's financial administration.\nThe audits conducted by the Comptroller General are essential for identifying policy gaps and recommending improvements.",
