        question: "Which of the following statements are true about the Ruhr industrial region in Germany?\n1. It is known for its coal and steel production.\n2. It is the largest industrial region in the world.\n3. It is located in the state of North Rhine-Westphalia.\n4. It faces environmental challenges due to heavy industrialization.",
