        question: "Consider the following statements regarding belt ranks and competition area in Judo:\n1) A red-and-white belt is associated with judokas from Sixth dan to Eighth dan levels.\n2) A shared safety zone of at least 3 meters must be maintained between adjoining competition areas.\nWhich of the above statements is/are correct?",
