        question: 'With reference to the Baul tradition of Bengal, consider the following statements:\n\n1) It is a mystical philosophy and music genre that emphasizes the search for the "Maner Manush" (the inner soul) while transcending formal religious boundaries.\n\n2) The musical performances are traditionally characterized by the use of instruments such as the Ektara and the Dubki.\n\nWhich of the statements given above is/are correct?',
