        answer: "a",
        solution: "Solution\n\nThe correct answer is Online management and disbursal of pensions.\n\nIn News\nSAMPANN (System for Accounting and Management of Pension) is an integrated online pension management system for Department of Telecommunications (DoT) pensioners, enabling direct pension disbursal and digital grievance redressal.\n\nKey Points\nProcesses, sanctions, and disburses pensions directly to DoT pensioners\u2019 bank accounts through a single online platform.\nProvides online grievance redressal, digital profile management, and transaction records.\nEnhances transparency and efficiency in pension management for telecom retirees.\nPension-related documents like Gratuity Payment Orders, Pension Certificates/ePPOs, Pension Commutation Orders, and Form 16 are available via DigiLocker.\n\nAdditional Information\nSAMPANN System\nLaunched to modernize pension management for Department of Telecommunications retirees.\nEnsures timely and accurate pension payments with minimal manual intervention.\nDigiLocker Integration\nFacilitates secure access to digital copies of pension-related documents.\nReduces dependency on physical documentation and paperwork.\nBenefits for Pensioners\nReal-time tracking of pension status.\nEasy lodging and resolution of grievances online.\nTransparent record-keeping and accountability.\nDoT Pensioners\nRetired employees of the Department of Telecommunications.\nPreviously relied on manual pension processing, now streamlined digitally via SAMPANN.",
