        question: "Consider the following statements regarding the recently updated UNESCO's Memory of the World Register:\nStatement 1: The Bhagavad Gita and Natyashastra have been inscribed into the UNESCO Memory of the World Register.\nStatement 2: India now has 18 entries among the 570 total collections globally.\nWhich of the above options is/are CORRECT?",
