        answer: "b",
        solution: "Solution\n\nThe correct answer is Manoj K Jha.\n\nIn News\nRajya Sabha MP and academic Manoj K Jha is the author of the book \u201CIn Praise of Coalition Politics: And Other Essays on Indian Democracy,\u201D published by Speaking Tiger.\n\nKey Points\nThe book is a compilation of essays and two of Jha\u2019s speeches in the Rajya Sabha.\nIt critically examines Indian democracy after a decade of majoritarian rule.\nSubjects discussed include minority welfare, caste census, federalism, healthcare, Hindutva, digital politics, and the Kashmir issue.\nThe foreword is written by former West Bengal governor Gopal Krishna Gandhi, adding literary and reflective depth.\n\nAdditional Information\nManoj K Jha\nSenior leader of the Rashtriya Janata Dal (RJD).\nServes as a Rajya Sabha MP and is known for his speeches on democracy and social justice.\nGopal Krishna Gandhi\nPenned the foreword for the book.\nFormer West Bengal governor and noted thinker, connected Jha\u2019s writings with echoes of poets Paash and Firaq Gorakhpuri.\nBook Details\nPublished by Speaking Tiger, priced at \u20B9399.\nBlends political and personal reflections with calls for plurality, debate, and justice.",
