        question: "Consider the following statements regarding Bharat Electricity Summit 2026:\n1. The theme of Bharat Electricity Summit 2026 is \u201CElectrifying Growth. Empowering Sustainability. Connecting Globally\u201D.\n2. The Ministry of New and Renewable Energy has conducted the summit.\nWhich of the above statements is/are correct?",
