        question: "Consider the following statements:\nStatement I: A six-year mission to boost pulses production, focusing on varieties like Tur, Urad, and Masoor.\nStatement II: This mission aims to significantly increase pulses imports to reduce domestic production costs.\nWhich one of the following is correct in respect of the above statements?",
